		{"id":"57c304d47cceb1ea","x":-400,"y":160,"width":250,"height":396,"type":"text","text":"Getting started\n- **Pre-writing:** this technique allows you to write out the ideas and connections you already have so that you can figure out what you would want to research more deeply about\n- **Outline**: Similarly this creates an outline of what we want to focus in on\n- Make a mess: Brain dump: Start writing and get as much that you know about the subject out so you can identify connections  "},
